WEBVTT

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.120
Mr. Scamander.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.960
We've never been properly
introduced.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:28.840
Henrietta Fischer...

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:30.480
Herr Vogel's attache.

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:32.560
(Newt) Ah. Yes, uh,

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:33.520
hello.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.560
I can take you up.

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:39.200
There's a private entrance for
members of the High Council.

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:41.960
If you just follow me.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.600
I'm sorry, why would you do that?

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:45.400
Take me up?

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:48.320
(hesitates) Isn't it obvious?

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.880
No, frankly, it's, uh, not.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:53.600
(horn blaring)

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:57.080
(whispering) Dumbledore sent me.

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:01.760
I know what you have
in that case, Mr.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:02.680
Scamander.

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:05.640
(uneasy music playing)

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:16.360
(thud)

00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:25.120
(Lally) He should be here any
minute.

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:31.520
(wind whistling)

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:39.680
(suspenseful music playing)

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:04.480
(uneasy music playing)

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:14.840
(all grunting)

00:02:26.320 --> 00:02:27.680
What kept you?

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:32.520
(swift whooshing)

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:38.120
(crowd clamoring)

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:44.120
(Vogel) I thank the
candidates for their words.

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:50.280
Each represents a distinct vision
of how we will not shape only our
world,

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:52.760
but the non-magical world as well.

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:59.000
Which brings us to the most
important part of our ceremony...

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:01.200
the walk of the Qilin.

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:05.240
(dramatic music playing)

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:06.680
(crowd cheering)

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:21.280
(chitters)

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:24.440
(Qilin trills)

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:29.880
(Qilin chitters)

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:31.880
(menacing music playing)

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:01.680
(Qilin trills)

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:04.240
(tense music playing)

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:17.200
(dramatic music playing)

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:22.680
(Qilin trills)

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:29.240
The Qilin has seen.

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:31.560
Seen goodness,

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:34.000
strength...

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:38.560
qualities essential to
lead and to guide us.

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:42.240
Who do you see?

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:45.400
-(all cheering) -(thrilling
music playing)

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:02.000
Gellert Grindelwald is the new
leader of the magical world...

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:03.720
by acclamation.

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:15.720
(cheering continues)

